From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:42:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin: enable lpass_tlmm for
 SoundWire

The SWR pinctrl states (tx_swr_active/rx_swr_active) live under the
LPASS-local TLMM (pinctrl@3440000).  With lpass_tlmm left disabled its
state nodes never appear, fw_devlink keeps both SoundWire controllers
in 'wait for supplier', the WCD938x never enumerates and the whole
sound card defers.  Found on the first RAM boot of the mic chain.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
index f04ffd542..5c08b8053 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
@@ -974,6 +974,11 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+/* SWR pinctrl states live under the LPASS-local TLMM; it must probe first. */
+&lpass_tlmm {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &rxmacro {
 	status = "okay";
 };
